00:09:22.790 --> 00:09:24.170
Joseph Sinclair (Hashgraph Foundry Inc. (DBA Hashgraph)): We, we don't currently.

41
00:09:26.950 --> 00:09:33.320
Richard Bair: They're in the, in the code, you'll find them in the, execution layer in…

